                ("Can we keep our logo and still reposition?", "Often, yes. Repositioning changes the decision; whether the logo can carry the new decision is a separate question, and frequently the answer is that it can with a refreshed system around it."),
                ("What should we do first?", "Run the diagnostic above honestly, ideally with someone who does not sell identity for a living. If the answer is a refresh, you have saved a great deal of money and recognition."),
