                ("Rank by frequency times pain", "A daily fifteen-minute task outranks a monthly two-hour one. Errors that reach customers outrank errors that stay internal."),
                ("Start with a handoff", "The transfer of information between two systems or two people is where duplication and delay concentrate. Automate one join, measure, then the next."),
