            P("Workflow tools such as n8n and Zapier connect systems that do not natively talk. CRM and email platforms carry marketing automation. Custom internal tools appear when the process is specific enough that no product fits it, which is more often than the vendors suggest and less often than developers suggest. The preference is always to wire what you already own before buying something new, because migrations cost more than anyone budgets for."),
