            P("The customer record is where marketing, sales, service and finance meet. When it is coherent, a business can answer simple questions: who are our best customers, what did they buy before, who has gone quiet. When it is not, those questions require a spreadsheet, an argument, and someone's memory. The [operating model](/insights/operating-model-explained) of the whole company runs through this record."),
