                "Source of truth: which system owns which fact. The CRM owns the relationship; the commerce platform owns the order; the support desk owns the ticket. Each connects to the others rather than duplicating them.",
                "Ownership: who is responsible for a record's accuracy at each stage, and what happens to records nobody owns.",
