                ("Decide the fields ruthlessly", "Every field is a tax on the person updating it. Keep the ones that drive a decision or a trigger. Delete the ones kept because someone might want them one day."),
                ("Choose the tool", "Now, and only now. Fit the tool to the process; the process that fits the tool is the vendor's process."),
