            P("The cost of an AI project that fails is not only the budget. It is the confidence spent, the data exposed, and the internal conclusion that 'AI does not work for us', which then blocks the use cases that would have. A readiness audit is cheaper than discovering three months into a build that the data was never clean enough."),
            H2("The four conditions"),
